cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "kimi-k3-in-rust: CPU inference for Kimi K3 in pure Rust"
type: software
authors:
  - name: undeemed
repository-code: "https://github.com/undeemed/kimi-k3-in-rust"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  CPU inference for Kimi K3, a 2.78 trillion parameter mixture-of-experts
  LLM, in pure Rust. No GPU, BLAS, PyTorch, or ONNX. Streams the checkpoint
  from disk with an 8 GB memory floor. A byte-identical port of
  kimi-k3-in-c.
keywords:
  - kimi-k3
  - rust
  - llm-inference
  - cpu-inference
  - mixture-of-experts
  - mxfp4
  - simd
references:
